- lb-kg 전환
```sql
select session_h.id, session_h.weight_type
  , set_h.count, set_h.weight
  , e.name as exercise_name, e.unit, e.has_weight, e.movement_pattern
  from user_exercise_session_history session_h
  join user_exercise_set_history set_h
    on session_h.id = set_h.user_exercise_session_history_id
  join exercise e
    on session_h.exercise_id = e.id
  order by session_h.id desc
  limit 10;
```

